1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
"Tamed"

2
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:36,400
(EP2: Moonlight and Aisles)

3
00:01:42,239 --> 00:01:44,005
(Li Meng / Mother of the Cheng brothers)
Mom.

4
00:01:44,159 --> 00:01:45,480
What brings you here today?

5
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:48,159
Your father's been making some big moves.

6
00:01:48,439 --> 00:01:50,000
Everyone's on edge.

7
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,400
I asked Zhou Zhi to come.

8
00:01:52,799 --> 00:01:54,879
He has a painting by Lin Yuanshan.

9
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:56,079
Take a look at it.

10
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:58,439
See if it can help with the case.

11
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:01,040
What on earth is your father doing?

12
00:02:01,359 --> 00:02:03,640
He never tells me anything anymore.

13
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:06,879
(Zhou Zhi)
Uncle Cheng's been looking out for himself,

14
00:02:07,159 --> 00:02:08,360
ignoring his sons.

15
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,599
Yu'an.

16
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,919
Yuze hasn't been home in days.

17
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,120
You're his big brother. Keep an eye on him.

18
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,720
Make sure he stays out of trouble.

19
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,080
Wait up!

20
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:28,599
Need a ride.

21
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,319
How have you been sleeping?

22
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,000
A little better than before.

23
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,159
More soundly.

24
00:02:40,759 --> 00:02:41,759
That's progress.

25
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,599
I wonder if it's the medication...

26
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:58,919
Brother.

27
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,680
I was going to call you later.

28
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,479
Mom came to see me this morning.

29
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:04,159
She said you haven't been home in days.

30
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,080
I knew it.

31
00:03:06,439 --> 00:03:07,439
What did she say?

32
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,719
To keep an eye on you.

33
00:03:08,879 --> 00:03:11,120
So how will you keep an eye on me?

34
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:12,520
Lock me up at home?

35
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,520
Or come hang out with me?

36
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,680
Where are you now?

37
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:16,800
I'm out.

38
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,080
At a friend's guesthouse.

39
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,760
A few friends will come over today.

40
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,080
You should come, too.

41
00:03:21,199 --> 00:03:21,800
I'm busy.

42
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:22,800
I can't get away.

43
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,879
Brother.

44
00:03:24,879 --> 00:03:26,360
When did you last take a break?

45
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,960
I don't need a break.

46
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,120
Brother.

47
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:29,960
Come on.

48
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:31,199
I want you here.

49
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:34,360
Send me the address.

50
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:35,360
OK.

51
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,360
Right away.

52
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:39,719
Will you be free this afternoon?

53
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,879
In theory,

54
00:03:43,879 --> 00:03:44,680
yes.

55
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,000
Come somewhere with me.

56
00:03:47,919 --> 00:03:48,639
It's my younger brother.

57
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:50,000
It won't be a formal session.

58
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Just...

59
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,439
get to know him a little.

60
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,599
Cheng Yu'an.

61
00:03:53,639 --> 00:03:55,400
You're crossing professional boundaries...

62
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:56,680
I know.

63
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:59,759
Just meet him as a friend for now.

64
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,560
I'll repay you.

65
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:02,599
I'll owe you one.

66
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,520
Lawyer Cheng actually showed up!

67
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,280
And he brought a friend, too.

68
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:14,400
You're here, too.

69
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:15,439
Where's Cheng Yuze?

70
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:16,439
Upstairs.

71
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,319
He said he's inspecting the rooms.

72
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,600
Long time no see.

73
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:30,959
You didn't tell me you were back home.

74
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,959
Where's the fun in that?

75
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:33,639
Well?

76
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:35,079
Not a bad place, right?

77
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,240
Since when is this your thing?

78
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:41,600
(Mu Ye) It always has been. I
just never had the chance before.

79
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,000
Brother.

80
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,040
Who's this?

81
00:05:15,399 --> 00:05:16,399
Shen Mo.

82
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:18,600
A therapist.

83
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,160
That's perfect.

84
00:05:20,959 --> 00:05:23,240
I haven't been sleeping well lately.

85
00:05:23,839 --> 00:05:25,240
Though I slept great last night.

86
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,319
Dr. Shen.

87
00:05:27,319 --> 00:05:29,639
Could I get a private bedtime session?

88
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:36,360
Forgive him.

89
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,440
He's always fooling around.

90
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:39,639
It's fine.

91
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:42,079
Everyone's here, right?

92
00:05:42,079 --> 00:05:43,120
Don't just stand there.

93
00:05:43,639 --> 00:05:44,360
Mu Ye.

94
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:45,240
Where's the wine?

95
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:45,839
Open a bottle.

96
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,160
You said a few friends.

97
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,160
You didn't say Mu Ye owned the guesthouse.

98
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:50,000
It's a surprise.

99
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,399
Don't you like surprises?

100
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:05,240
Brother Yu'an.

101
00:06:05,264 --> 00:06:06,250
Do you have a pet, too?

102
00:06:15,079 --> 00:06:16,079
I do.

103
00:06:20,959 --> 00:06:21,959
Come on, guys.

104
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,720
Make yourselves at home.

105
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,199
Kick back and relax.

106
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,240
There's plenty of booze to go around.

107
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,480
Thanks.

108
00:06:31,959 --> 00:06:32,720
Come on.

109
00:06:32,879 --> 00:06:33,680
Let's take

110
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,879
a group photo to celebrate our opening.

111
00:06:35,879 --> 00:06:36,879
Sound good?

112
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,560
Come on, everyone.

113
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,040
Wake up, Sesame.

114
00:06:50,279 --> 00:06:50,720
OK.

115
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,759
Is everyone ready?

116
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,000
Look at the camera.

117
00:06:54,079 --> 00:06:55,079
3.

118
00:06:55,959 --> 00:06:57,000
2.

119
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,160
1.

120
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,360
Cheers!

121
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:05,759
Cheers!

122
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:06,759
Cheers!

123
00:07:09,639 --> 00:07:10,680
Just drinking is boring.

124
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:11,879
Let's play a game.

125
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,360
Truth or dare?

126
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,360
I'm in.

127
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:17,759
Truth.

128
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,000
Zhou Zhi.

129
00:07:19,199 --> 00:07:21,639
When did you last say what you didn't mean?

130
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,560
This morning.

131
00:07:24,279 --> 00:07:24,879
This morning?

132
00:07:25,199 --> 00:07:26,199
What did you say?

133
00:07:26,439 --> 00:07:27,480
That's another question.

134
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:28,519
Ask on my next turn.

135
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:29,480
Such a spoilsport.

136
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,040
My turn!

137
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:30,879
Ready?

138
00:07:30,879 --> 00:07:31,199
3.

139
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:31,480
2.

140
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,480
1.

141
00:07:33,399 --> 00:07:34,959
I'll go with truth, too.

142
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:37,160
Is there someone

143
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:39,040
you're really into,

144
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,439
someone you can't forget?

145
00:07:50,759 --> 00:07:51,759
Yes.

146
00:07:52,079 --> 00:07:52,879
Last night.

147
00:07:53,079 --> 00:07:54,079
That recent?

148
00:07:56,399 --> 00:07:57,399
I'm serious.

149
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,920
Really?

150
00:08:01,079 --> 00:08:02,120
Come on, let's keep going.

151
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,720
OK.

152
00:08:06,959 --> 00:08:08,360
Truth or dare?

153
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,480
Dare.

154
00:08:16,519 --> 00:08:17,519
OK, then.

155
00:08:18,639 --> 00:08:20,839
The third person to your right...

156
00:08:20,839 --> 00:08:22,959
Hold their gaze for 30 seconds.

157
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:28,120
Come on.

158
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:28,759
Thirty seconds.

159
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,800
I'll time you.

160
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,439
3.

161
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:32,279
2.

162
00:08:32,279 --> 00:08:33,159
1.

163
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:34,159
Go!

164
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,600
No backing out.

165
00:09:04,895 --> 00:09:06,968
[Party A Signature:  Lin Qi]

166
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:16,799
29.2.

167
00:09:16,799 --> 00:09:17,159
Kidding.

168
00:09:17,159 --> 00:09:18,159
30!

169
00:09:19,759 --> 00:09:20,759
You did it!

170
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,679
I'll go to the bathroom.

171
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,080
Sesame.

172
00:09:54,639 --> 00:09:55,639
Sesame.

173
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,600
Sesame.

174
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,600
Take your pick.

175
00:10:01,559 --> 00:10:02,559
Dare.

176
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,039
OK.

177
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:06,159
Call that person you like.

178
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,480
The one from last night.

179
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,279
I didn't get their number.

180
00:10:16,279 --> 00:10:17,240
No way!

181
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,240
I really didn't.

182
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,679
Then take your penalty.

183
00:10:19,679 --> 00:10:20,759
You just won't call.

184
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:21,759
Drink up!

185
00:10:22,039 --> 00:10:23,039
Then drink mine, too.

186
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:23,759
Pour it.

187
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:24,880
I'll take a drink for him.

188
00:10:27,039 --> 00:10:27,879
Drink up!

189
00:10:27,879 --> 00:10:28,480
Wait...

190
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,600
Since when can you call for backup?

191
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,320
OK.

192
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,400
Come on, let's keep going.

193
00:10:43,559 --> 00:10:44,679
I'll step out for a bit.

194
00:10:58,399 --> 00:10:59,399
Sesame.

195
00:11:00,679 --> 00:11:01,679
Sesame.

196
00:11:05,379 --> 00:11:06,379
Sesame.

197
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,720
Sesame.

198
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:11,559
Sesame.

199
00:11:23,399 --> 00:11:24,799
The cat got out.

200
00:11:26,399 --> 00:11:27,399
I know.

201
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,080
Found it?

202
00:11:38,879 --> 00:11:39,440
No.

203
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:41,200
It ran down there.

204
00:12:13,399 --> 00:12:14,759
I think the door's locked.

205
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:16,960
What do we do?

206
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:26,799
I'll...

207
00:12:26,799 --> 00:12:27,799
I'll go check.

208
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,080
What do we do?

209
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,600
Canned cat food.

210
00:12:48,039 --> 00:12:49,039
Lure it out.

211
00:13:11,679 --> 00:13:12,960
Let's go, puppy.

212
00:13:19,639 --> 00:13:20,639
Sesame.

213
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:40,879
So this is where you're hiding, Dr. Shen.

214
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,480
Getting some air.

215
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,080
It's sweet.

216
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:56,799
You slipped some sugar in?

217
00:13:59,919 --> 00:14:00,919
Need something?

218
00:14:08,039 --> 00:14:08,960
What do you think,

219
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,960
Dr. Shen?

220
00:14:11,679 --> 00:14:13,600
You started it last night.

221
00:14:13,879 --> 00:14:15,080
You didn't say no.

222
00:14:15,279 --> 00:14:17,120
There's plenty I don't say no to.

223
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:20,480
Then don't say no now, either.

224
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,600
Cheng Yuze.

225
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:30,480
You're here on vacation. So am I.

226
00:14:30,879 --> 00:14:32,879
Last night was an accident.

227
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,039
It doesn't mean we have to keep this going.

228
00:14:41,919 --> 00:14:42,919
An accident?

229
00:14:44,679 --> 00:14:46,039
We're both adults.

230
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:49,080
I want to know

231
00:14:49,799 --> 00:14:51,039
what I am to you.

232
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,440
A one-night stand?

233
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,279
Or...

234
00:14:56,399 --> 00:14:57,879
do you think about last night, too?

235
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,240
Just call it an accident.

236
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,720
But I don't think it was an accident.

237
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,360
You'll regret this.

238
00:15:18,639 --> 00:15:19,759
I won't.

239
00:15:21,279 --> 00:15:22,879
You're the one who'll regret it.

240
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:25,159
Because you want this so badly,

241
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,320
but you won't admit it.

242
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,320
Cheng Yuze.

243
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,399
Call me Zafe.

244
00:15:43,399 --> 00:15:44,399
I'll head back first.

245
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:22,320
Extra session tomorrow morning.

246
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:24,406
[Secretary] OK.

247
00:16:29,566 --> 00:16:31,092
[Lin Qi posted a photo with no
caption on his Wechat 1 hour ago]

248
00:16:37,119 --> 00:16:39,499
[Convo with Lin Qi. Previous message was the
"pet" agreement. Now he's typing "Good night."]

249
00:17:26,039 --> 00:17:26,720
Brother.

250
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:28,359
Look at you, all domestic.

251
00:17:28,599 --> 00:17:30,199
I thought I'd walked onto the wrong set.

252
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,400
Where's Dr. Shen?

253
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,759
Just eat your fruit.

254
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:35,000
Something came up at his clinic.

255
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:36,000
He left early.

256
00:17:36,559 --> 00:17:37,319
Xiao Ze.

257
00:17:37,519 --> 00:17:38,959
Call your friend down for breakfast.

258
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:39,960
Lin Qi?

259
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,416
He got a call first thing this morning.

260
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,200
Something came up.

261
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,200
He left, too.

262
00:17:43,599 --> 00:17:44,039
He left?

263
00:17:44,039 --> 00:17:44,359
Yeah.

264
00:17:44,359 --> 00:17:45,359
You were all up so early.

265
00:17:45,359 --> 00:17:46,519
Did you black out last night?

266
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,759
As if!

267
00:17:47,759 --> 00:17:49,000
You know I can hold my liquor.

268
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,279
Keep telling yourself that.

269
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,680
If you ask me,

270
00:17:54,039 --> 00:17:55,839
when your guesthouse goes public,

271
00:17:56,359 --> 00:17:57,680
your brand ambassador

272
00:17:57,799 --> 00:17:58,759
has to be Xiao Ze.

273
00:17:58,759 --> 00:17:59,759
Right?

274
00:18:00,079 --> 00:18:01,279
I couldn't afford him.

275
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:03,640
Dad.

276
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:06,440
Your brother dropped out without telling us

277
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,400
to play in some band.

278
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:09,079
Go bring him home right now.

279
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:10,680
He doesn't want to come home.

280
00:18:11,039 --> 00:18:12,200
Dragging him back

281
00:18:12,640 --> 00:18:13,799
will only make things worse.

282
00:18:14,079 --> 00:18:15,279
Then what do you suggest?

283
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,240
He's never listened to a word I say.

284
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:19,519
His defiance will get him into big trouble.

285
00:18:19,559 --> 00:18:21,799
I'll arrange psychological counselin
with Cheng Group's doctors.

286
00:18:22,759 --> 00:18:24,200
Once he's doing better,

287
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:25,599
he can come home.

288
00:18:26,359 --> 00:18:27,359
OK.

289
00:18:27,559 --> 00:18:28,559
But...

290
00:18:28,839 --> 00:18:29,960
I want to meet up first.

291
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:31,960
I'll arrange it.

292
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:36,480
By then, Xiao Ze will

293
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:38,240
tour the world, right?

294
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:39,519
We'll have to show our support.

295
00:18:39,519 --> 00:18:41,559
He'll have so many fans by then.

296
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:43,160
Tickets will be like impossible to get.

297
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:44,640
We'll be lucky to even see him.

298
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:47,319
Brother.

299
00:18:47,319 --> 00:18:48,000
Your car keys.

300
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:50,040
I need to get Lin Qi from the police station.

301
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:53,079
You have something more important to do.

302
00:18:53,079 --> 00:18:54,936
Go through the motions
at at Shen Mo's clinic.

303
00:18:54,960 --> 00:18:55,759
Otherwise,

304
00:18:55,839 --> 00:18:57,599
Dad will shave off your puppy fur tonight.

305
00:18:57,759 --> 00:18:59,759
But Lin Qi's already at the station.

306
00:18:59,759 --> 00:19:00,680
I need to pick him up.

307
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:01,680
I'll get him.

308
00:19:03,279 --> 00:19:04,319
OK.

309
00:19:04,599 --> 00:19:06,319
You're better at getting people out anyway.

310
00:19:06,456 --> 00:19:07,815
I'll go get my fur stroked, then.

311
00:19:07,839 --> 00:19:10,559
I've sent you the contact info and address for
Shen Mo's clinic.

312
00:19:24,079 --> 00:19:25,079
You fight, too?

313
00:19:26,799 --> 00:19:28,119
They went after my mom.

314
00:19:28,119 --> 00:19:29,359
What else was I supposed to do?

315
00:19:43,319 --> 00:19:44,319
Does it still hurt?

316
00:19:47,359 --> 00:19:48,839
It didn't before you touched it.

317
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:50,480
Now it does.

318
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:54,880
Don't be scared, Xiao Qi.

319
00:19:55,119 --> 00:19:56,599
Daddy will be back soon.

320
00:20:01,839 --> 00:20:03,000
Dad!

321
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:04,519
Xiao Qi got hit by a car!

322
00:20:04,799 --> 00:20:06,279
Please save it!

323
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:08,440
It's just a dog.

324
00:20:09,559 --> 00:20:10,559
Get rid of it.

325
00:20:15,039 --> 00:20:16,240
You're filthy.

326
00:20:16,559 --> 00:20:17,559
Go take a bath.

327
00:20:21,079 --> 00:20:22,200
But...

328
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:30,880
So...

329
00:20:32,039 --> 00:20:33,480
you were waiting for me to help?

330
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:38,400
Yeah.

331
00:20:48,599 --> 00:20:49,599
Come in.

332
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:50,680
It's drafty by the door.

333
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:51,759
Aren't you cold?

334
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,400
Take your clothes off.

335
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:03,400
Can you move your hands?

336
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:05,400
Yes.

337
00:21:07,039 --> 00:21:08,400
The water will get cold soon.

338
00:21:12,472 --> 00:21:14,712
Could you turn around?

339
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:05,200
Sit up a little.

340
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:28,279
That feels pretty good.

341
00:22:29,119 --> 00:22:30,119
Stop moving.

342
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:32,640
OK.

343
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,720
A little more pressure.

344
00:22:47,400 --> 00:22:48,720
You're pretty demanding.

345
00:22:56,240 --> 00:22:58,519
When I was signing
documents at the station today,

346
00:22:59,279 --> 00:23:00,880
my hand wouldn't stop shaking.

347
00:23:05,599 --> 00:23:07,640
My hands never shake when I paint.

348
00:23:19,480 --> 00:23:20,480
Close your eyes.

349
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:22,920
Move again and I'll throw you out.

350
00:23:49,359 --> 00:23:50,039
Brother.

351
00:23:50,279 --> 00:23:51,319
Are you home?

352
00:23:52,319 --> 00:23:53,319
Brother?

353
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:54,880
Where are you?

354
00:23:57,916 --> 00:23:59,723
[Episode 2: done]

355
00:24:00,039 --> 00:24:01,440
A few friends will come over today.

356
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:02,839
You should come, too.

357
00:24:02,839 --> 00:24:03,359
I'm busy.

358
00:24:03,359 --> 00:24:04,359
I don't have time.

359
00:24:05,599 --> 00:24:06,039
Lin Qi.

360
00:24:06,319 --> 00:24:07,639
Help me get another case of wine.

361
00:24:12,519 --> 00:24:13,559
Send me the address.

362
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:17,595
(Next Episode)
Even if it's playing with fire,

363
00:24:17,619 --> 00:24:18,700
and I get burned,

364
00:24:19,500 --> 00:24:20,700
I'm willing to take that risk.

365
00:24:21,220 --> 00:24:22,220
Keep an eye on him.

366
00:24:22,559 --> 00:24:23,839
Don't let him out of your sight.

367
00:24:24,200 --> 00:24:25,200
Understood.

368
00:24:29,579 --> 00:24:32,180
Lin Yuanshan's sketches, unpublished when he died,

369
00:24:32,519 --> 00:24:33,519
or

370
00:24:33,779 --> 00:24:36,299
the whereabouts of his missing son.

371
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:38,299
Give me either one,

372
00:24:38,779 --> 00:24:39,839
and we'll call it even.
